{"parse": {"title": "TSR-07", "pageid": 28148, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSR-06\" title=\"TSR-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSR-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSR-08\" title=\"TSR-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AF.BB.E5.B8.B8.E4.B9.8B.E9.97.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"寻常之门\">寻常之门</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 寻常之门</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Ordinary Door</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1770107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_beihoudemen\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_beihoudemen\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_beihoudemen.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这并不是一扇难以寻找的门。<br />你很快就找到了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇悲伤的门。白蜡烛燃烧在侧边，你听见亲眷友人的啜泣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇亲近的门。鸟儿停驻在上头，你听到鸟儿明媚的鸣声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你伸出手，推开了门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迪塔斯多夫家比往日更加冷清，路过的人们行色匆忙，唯恐粘连其中不幸的运气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……伊索尔德，我很抱歉发生了这种事，希望您不要太过于难过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>这段时间，如果您需要陪伴，随时都可以打电话给我，朋友的陪伴是很重要的，尤其是在这种时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>当然，如果您认为居住在家中让您压力过大，您也可以来我的诊所暂住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡卡尼亚回过头，看向站在门边的伊索尔德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一如往常，端庄而挺拔地站立着，她身形纤细，面色苍白，眼下带有乌青。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>很感谢您的关心，卡卡尼亚小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>我……我会没事的，我能坚持得住，请您相信我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停顿片刻，伊索尔德缓慢地垂下眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>此时此刻的迪塔斯多夫比往日更加需要我。我的名声与身份在当下毫无作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>西奥菲尔的身体不再适合在教堂举行丧礼，他的情况复杂，事情又发生得突然……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>卡尔先生建议提早他下葬的日子，好让他更快获得安宁，而非痛苦地徘徊在这世界中……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>女仆在收拾他的房间，他的画作中三分之一会随他一同入葬，而他与模特们的赠予物与钱财纠葛目前仍没有打理出清晰的眉目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>……我，而我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迟疑着，缓慢地侧开脸，望向装点华贵的庄园铁门。连日的疏于打理，已经让它的缝隙滋生尘垢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>我是最后一个迪塔斯多夫，我需要负担起这些责任，卡卡尼亚小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>我不能再这样拖着患病的躯体，不能再随时担心着昏厥与惊恐发作，我不能再任由脏器在我身体中游荡，让我变成一个可怕的疯子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>伊索尔德……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>我已经下定决心了，接受施瓦茨医生的治疗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊索尔德抬起头，对着卡卡尼亚露出一个微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>这是新时代，新的诊疗方法层出不穷。我相信我一定会有救的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的朋友沉默着，最终轻轻地叹出一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>施瓦茨并不是一个好医生，您的身份特殊，他对您的收治更多是为了利益与人们的关注。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>他强烈地要求您参加公开诊疗就是最明晰的证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>作为您的朋友，我明白您的不易，也尊重您的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>但我希望您能在感到痛苦或是不舒服时立刻告诉他，让他停止治疗……这是对您最基础的保障！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>这……是病人应该做的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我不太清楚这是不是病人应该做的，但这是一个“人”应该做的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>哦……不过也有可能，您当时出于某些原因，而无法提出这个愿望……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡卡尼亚摸了摸下巴，她的眼睛亮起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>是了！别担心，既然那是公开诊疗，我当然也能去参观了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我会在台下看着您的，如果他让情况变得太失控，也许我可以帮您叫停……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新点子让绿裙姑娘愉快起来，她的声音清亮，如同一只色彩缤纷的鹦鹉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊索尔德只是安静地听着，时不时因为她延续下来的猜想而低声轻笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>……多谢您的宽慰，卡卡尼亚小姐。您是一个很好的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笑意仍未从伊索尔德脸上褪去，几乎雪片一般毫无血色的面颊上因为愉快而增添了一层红晕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从门边走开，向前一步，为卡卡尼亚整理衣领，就像是她过去无数次所做的一样自然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>对了，您刚刚在我家中的时候，有没有留意到过一扇门？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>一扇门？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡卡尼亚疑惑地抬起头，看向身旁的庄园铁门，而后又把视线转回到伊索尔德的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>那是一扇什么样子的门？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>只是一扇普通的门，再普通不过的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>哎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眨眨眼睛，更加困惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我不明白您的问题，伊索尔德。你们家有太多房间，也有太多扇门，您说的是哪一扇呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>不……不，没什么，那不是一个重要的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊索尔德收回了手，她已经打理好了衣领的褶皱，向后退回一步，回到庄园大门之内的区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>您是时候回去了，时间已经不早了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>天啊，居然已经这个时间了——是的，我是得赶紧回去了，我稍后还有一个病……啊不，一个需要“巫术”帮助的来访者呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>多谢您的提醒，伊索尔德！那么，我就先告辞了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡卡尼亚压压帽檐，拎着手提箱，姿态灵巧地后退离开，逐渐融入人群。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的女仆走上前来，推动巨大的金属门扉，替代庄园辞别今日最后的客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>卡卡尼亚小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊索尔德的声音伴随着金属轮压过地面的吱呀声传出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群之中，一只飘扬的绿色羽毛抖动了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-308013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>嗯？什么——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>如果施瓦茨医生的电椅对我没有效用，我能请您为我治疗吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-308010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-308010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-308010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>当然了！我随时都很欢迎您！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只羽毛欢悦地跳跃起来，它绕过人群，从一个空隙中钻出。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_kakaniya4\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_kakaniya4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_kakaniya4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>您是我在维也纳最好的朋友，我很高兴能帮上您的忙！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSR-07"}}